pyDynamo re-implements algorithms of Dynamo (https://www.dynamo-em.org) in Python/CUDA. The GPU rotation
kernel, the orientation-set generator and the averaging and wedge conventions are ports of Dynamo's
implementation, made to reproduce its results. Dynamo itself is not included in this repository.
